		<title type="html"><![CDATA[MD-9600 timeslot confusion]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=3909&amp;p=30347#p30347"><![CDATA[
Dear Opengd77 dev team,<br><br>For this test I'm using a MD9600 with build 20240317165151 HW v5  and a MDUV380 with build 20240312163717 b453219 D.<br>I have an MMDVM DMR repeater running WPSD with modem firmware version RB_STM_DVM:20221121. It listens on 433.975 MHz and sends on 145.275 MHz.<br>When I key up with the MD-9600 on TS1  I see TS2 in the MMDVM logs. The same when I key up on TS2 I see TS1 in the MMDVM logs.<br>When I do the same test with my MD-UV380 everything works correct.<br>When I do the same test with the MD9600 on a local Hytera repeater (ON0NOK), which is in the 70cm band with RX and TX, the timeslots received by the repeater are correct.<br><br>MMDVM logs - keyup MD-9600 on TS1:<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:20:04.112 Debug: DMRSlotRX: voice header found slot/pos/centre/threshold 2 444 -31 168<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:20:04.171 DMR Slot 2, received RF voice header from ON9CJA to TG 9<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:20:04.172 Debug: DMRSlotRX: voice header found slot/pos/centre/threshold 2 444 -22 167<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:20:04.232 Debug: DMRSlotRX: voice header found slot/pos/centre/threshold 2 444 -9 167<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:20:04.291 Debug: DMRSlotRX: voice sync found slot/pos/centre/threshold 2 444 1 167<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:20:04.651 Debug: DMRSlotRX: voice sync found slot/pos/centre/threshold 2 444 1 168<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:20:05.011 Debug: DMRSlotRX: voice sync found slot/pos/centre/threshold 2 444 -1 170<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:20:05.731 Debug: DMRSlotRX: voice sync found slot/pos/centre/threshold 2 444 -5 175<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:20:06.452 Debug: DMRSlotRX: voice terminator found slot/pos/centre/threshold 2 444 7 182<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:20:06.458 DMR Slot 2, received RF end of voice transmission from ON9CJA to TG 9, 2.2 seconds, BER: 0.0%, RSSI: -43/-43/-43 dBm<br><br>MMDVM logs - keyup MD-9600 on TS2:<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:23:26.233 Debug: DMRSlotRX: voice header found slot/pos/centre/threshold 1 445 -27 175<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:23:26.287 DMR Slot 1, received RF voice header from ON9CJA to TG 9<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:23:26.293 Debug: DMRSlotRX: voice header found slot/pos/centre/threshold 1 445 -16 174<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:23:26.353 Debug: DMRSlotRX: voice header found slot/pos/centre/threshold 1 445 -3 174<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:23:26.412 Debug: DMRSlotRX: voice sync found slot/pos/centre/threshold 1 445 7 173<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:23:27.132 Debug: DMRSlotRX: voice sync found slot/pos/centre/threshold 1 445 13 170<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:23:27.492 Debug: DMRSlotRX: voice sync found slot/pos/centre/threshold 1 445 8 167<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:23:28.213 Debug: DMRSlotRX: voice terminator found slot/pos/centre/threshold 1 445 2 168<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:23:28.219 DMR Slot 1, received RF end of voice transmission from ON9CJA to TG 9, 1.8 seconds, BER: 0.0%, RSSI: -43/-43/-43 dBm<br><br>MMDVM logs - keyup MD-UV380 on TS1:<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:25:41.320 Debug: DMRSlotRX: voice header found slot/pos/centre/threshold 1 445 -33 173<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:25:41.354 DMR Slot 1, received RF voice header from ON9CJA to TG 9<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:25:41.379 Debug: DMRSlotRX: voice header found slot/pos/centre/threshold 1 445 -28 172<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:25:41.439 Debug: DMRSlotRX: voice header found slot/pos/centre/threshold 1 445 -20 172<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:25:41.499 Debug: DMRSlotRX: voice sync found slot/pos/centre/threshold 1 445 -17 171<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:25:41.859 Debug: DMRSlotRX: voice sync found slot/pos/centre/threshold 1 445 -12 170<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:25:42.219 Debug: DMRSlotRX: voice sync found slot/pos/centre/threshold 1 445 -11 167<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:25:42.939 Debug: DMRSlotRX: voice sync found slot/pos/centre/threshold 1 445 -10 161<br><br>MMDVM logs - keyup MD-UV380 on TS2:<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:30:10.261 Debug: DMRSlotRX: voice header found slot/pos/centre/threshold 2 446 -37 181<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:30:10.316 DMR Slot 2, received RF voice header from ON9CJA to TG 9<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:30:10.321 Debug: DMRSlotRX: voice header found slot/pos/centre/threshold 2 446 -30 180<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:30:10.381 Debug: DMRSlotRX: voice header found slot/pos/centre/threshold 2 446 -22 180<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:30:10.441 Debug: DMRSlotRX: voice sync found slot/pos/centre/threshold 2 446 -14 178<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:30:11.161 Debug: DMRSlotRX: voice sync found slot/pos/centre/threshold 2 446 -7 173<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:30:12.241 Debug: DMRSlotRX: voice sync found slot/pos/centre/threshold 2 446 -9 164<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:30:12.601 Debug: DMRSlotRX: voice terminator found slot/pos/centre/threshold 2 446 -7 163<br>M: 2024-03-24 15:30:12.607 DMR Slot 2, received RF end of voice transmission from ON9CJA to TG 9, 2.2 seconds, BER: 0.1%, RSSI: -43/-43/-43 dBm<br><br>Could this behaviour be triggered by a misconfiguration in the MD-9600?<br>Did you see this problem before? <br> <br>Thanks<br>73s<br>Joris<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=3825">ON9CJA</a> — Sun Mar 24, 2024 3:41 pm</p><hr />
